  "system": {
    "identifier": "fushin-typhoon-release-whirlwind-bomb",
    "description": "<p>You condense a rampaging ball of wind before throwing it, causing it to explode. Make a ranged ninjutsu (or taijutsu) attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 8d6 wind damage. Hit or miss, each creature within 15 feet of the target, excluding the original target, must make a Constitution saving throw or take 4d6 wind damage and becoming Dazed.</p>\n<p>Critical Success: Affected creatures take half of 4d6 wind damage.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creatures take half of 4d6 wind damage and are Dazzled.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creatures take 4d6 wind damage are Dazed.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Affected creatures take the same damage as the original target and are Dazed.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6.</p>",
